{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Independent nonauthor merged-SHA review receipt, part 2/6 (24 rows; 142 total). Reviewer session: resume-group03-20261023. Immutable before: b65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd. Reviewed signed candidate: b46efb88356c0d78ee726007b12a62d4feae6ffe. Exact Gerrit 3096 merged SHA: 5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89. All 28 grouped changed path blobs, including generated docs/env-vars.md, are byte-identical candidate→merged. Every selected row has directives, semantic preservation, and bloat removal PASS with a strict word reduction. Complete 142-row TSV SHA-256: 02e042abbe56804e72d174b1f2b63f9a826f37affa92238e25552c9aef9ec1e9.\n\n```tsv\nstable_block_id\tbefore_citation\tfinal_citation\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tdirectives_exact\tbefore_words\tafter_words\tsemantic-preservation\tbloat-removal\treviewer_session\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:lifespan@300-304\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:300-304\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:230-231\tStart snapshot cleanup off the hot path. Janitor failure must not block review-bot startup.\tPASS\t58\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:lifespan@317-328\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:317-328\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:244-246\tDrain acknowledged queue work before cancellation. One deadline covers the queue and reconciler so shutdown stays below the container stop budget. Backfill recovers events left queued after that deadline.\tPASS\t133\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:lifespan@341-360\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:341-360\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:259-262\tAfter queue drain, wait only if the reconciler still has a review in flight. Share the remaining deadline. asyncio.wait returns on timeout without cancelling and then waiting indefinitely. Bounded cancel below handles the remaining task.\tPASS\t240\t36\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:lifespan@365-373\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:365-373\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:267-268\tBound task cancellation and await. Offloaded OS work may continue, but gather returns coroutine errors without extending shutdown.\tPASS\t107\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:lifespan@380-387\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:380-387\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:275-276\tClear the module-wide reconciler stop flag after shutdown. CLI backfill and later app instances can otherwise skip every candidate.\tPASS\t107\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:lifespan@389-400\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:389-400\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:278-280\tArm hard exit only for surviving named offload threads. Give a bounded store write time to release its mkdir lock first. The total deadline precedes Docker's stop kill.\tPASS\t145\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::D:_current_revision@413-424\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:413-424\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:293-294\tReturn Gerrit's current revision or None on lookup or shape failure. The queued event still proceeds when currency cannot be checked.\tPASS\t127\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::D:_superseded_by@442-446\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:442-446\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:312-314\tReturn the newer Gerrit revision when a queued event is stale. Unknown or matching revisions proceed. Run the blocking lookup off the event loop.\tPASS\t50\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::D:_worker@457-464\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:457-464\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:325-327\tDrain queued events with one bounded review and vote per event. Log failures and timed-out work as VOTER_ERROR, then continue so one event cannot stall the queue.\tPASS\t85\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:_worker@469-472\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:469-472\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:332-333\tCheck contributor rerun eligibility through privileged REST calls, then queue the current revision for the normal worker path.\tPASS\t44\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:_worker@485-496\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:485-496\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:346-348\tSkip superseded queued revisions before costly review or stale votes. Forced and manual reruns already use the current revision and bypass this check. Unknown currency proceeds so a lookup error cannot lose work.\tPASS\t127\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:_worker@512-515\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:512-515\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:364-365\tAbandon a timed-out review without a vote and emit VOTER_ERROR. Backfill can retry while the worker continues draining.\tPASS\t50\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::D:_discard_superseded@538-542\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:538-542\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:388-388\tEmit a VOTER_ERROR marker for a stale event discarded before review.\tPASS\t48\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:module@564-567\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:564-567\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:410-411\tInstall structured rebar logging before app startup so INFO events reach stdout beside uvicorn logs.\tPASS\t53\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:module@570-574\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:570-574\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:414-415\tRedact query tokens from uvicorn access logs at import time. The deployed Gerrit webhook plugin still uses query-token delivery.\tPASS\t56\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/app.py::C:rerun@721-723\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:721-723\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:562-563\tWrite the durable rerun marker before acknowledgement. Reset the vote to neutral and fail closed if a nonzero vote survives.\tPASS\t35\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::D:module@1-20\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:1-20\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:1-5\tEnvironment-backed receiver settings and logging helpers. SSM supplies deployment variables before startup. Verdict thresholds come from the four-pass gate, while this module supplies Gerrit label values, timeouts, endpoint settings, and token redaction without importing FastAPI or the agents extra. Generated registry citation: b46efb88356c0d78ee726007b12a62d4feae6ffe:docs/env-vars.md:186.\tPASS\t174\t39\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::C:module@35-51\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:35-51\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:20-23\tDrain acknowledged reviews for up to the review timeout before cancel. An empty queue returns promptly. Backfill recovers work left queued. Keep this setting readable without importing FastAPI and below the container stop deadline.\tPASS\t201\t34\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::C:module@54-64\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:54-64\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:26-28\tBound post-drain task cancellation and await. Offloaded OS work may continue after coroutine cancellation, so hard exit has its own grace. Expose this budget without importing the app.\tPASS\t130\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::C:module@67-71\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:67-71\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:31-33\tAfter this many attempts at one change revision, a retryable coverage gap escalates from vote-less deferral to a fail-closed vote. A successful vote or explicit reset clears the attempt ledger.\tPASS\t60\t30\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::C:module@74-77\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:74-77\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:36-37\tLimit how long a retryable candidate can hold back the backfill cursor. The default 24 hours bounds a permanent poison pill.\tPASS\t51\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::D:review_timeout_seconds@86-91\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:86-91\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:46-47\tReturn a positive REVIEW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS or the shared default. Both worker and backfill use this setting without importing the app.\tPASS\t54\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::D:shutdown_force_exit_grace_seconds@132-153\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:132-153\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:88-91\tReturn the lock-acquisition plus git-call budget after bounded cancel. A blocked to_thread worker may survive coroutine cancellation. The hard-exit grace gives a store write time to release its lock and still precedes the container stop deadline.\tPASS\t240\t36\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::D:configure_logging@161-186\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:161-186\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:99-101\tAdd one stdout handler to the rebar logger for structured INFO events. Use REVIEW_BOT_LOG_LEVEL with INFO fallback. Leave propagation unchanged so root handlers such as pytest caplog still receive records.\tPASS\t249\t30\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792822747822533546,"uuid":"f9aaa645-dd11-4661-8be7-7c51c177ef24"}